            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Chuck Royce's Strategic Acquisition in SecureWorks Corp",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "On September 30, 2024, Chuck Royce (Trades, Portfolio), through Royce Pennsylvania Mutual Fund, executed a notable transaction by acquiring 32,929 additional shares of SecureWorks Corp (NASDAQ:SCWX).  The shares were purchased at a price of $8.85 each, reflecting a strategic addition to the firm's portfolio, which now holds a 0.11% position in SecureWorks, translating to a 7.03% ownership of the traded stock.  Charles M. Royce, a renowned figure in the investment world, has been at the helm of Royce Pennsylvania Mutual Fund since 1972.",
